A connective ending used to:   
1. list two or more equal facts;   
2. indicate events occur in order;   
3. retain a preceding action or result during the following action;   
4. list opposites;   
5. emphasize an adjective through repetition;   
6. connect 이다, verbs or adjectives to auxiliaries such as 있다, 싶다, 말다 and 나다.

