Particles indicating:   
1. choosing something unsatisfactory;   
2. acting as if something untrue were true;   
3. an unexpectedly large quantity;   
4. a rough estimate;   
5. a small but present amount;   
6. inclusion of all alternatives;   
7. little interest in or a casual question about quoted content;   
8. equal connection or choice of one among things;   
9. an object as the best qualification or condition.

